				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "If going wireless, add a \n<5mm thick battery\nhere and solder the \nbattery cut-off switch\non back of PCB. \n\nHard soldering the\nbattery is recommended\nfor heigh contraints.\n\nWarning!!!\nVerify polarity on \nbattery before \nsoldering!"
		(at 119.59 68.3 0)
