	(gr_text "1. Solder hotswap sockets from rear of PCB, follow outline\n2. Solder capacitors (C1 & C2) from rear (unidirectional)\n3. Cut ends of legs flush on front side (underneath encoder)\n4. Solder RGB from rear, orient by arrow/marked leg \n5. Solder controller on rear of PCB, facing up\n6. Solder encoder from front of PCB (Bend ground tabs!)\n7. Assemble, Flash and Enjoy!"
		(at 127.57 47.33 90)
